  "solution": {
    "text": "Let the chord is <math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math> which subtends an angle <math><mi>&#952;</mi></math> at the centre <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>360</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>120</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8736;</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi></math><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0005_4f0262567348.png\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 170px;\" /><br />Let the distance of <math><mi>O</mi></math> from <math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi></math><br />Then,&nbsp;<math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br />Let the equation of the chord is <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> whose distance from <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to <math><mn>5</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>49</mn><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>24</mn><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> Chords are perpendicular"
